SUMMARY:English Teacher and Bakhmaro 2050
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:These two creative documentaries that ruminate on issues facing
  Georgian society are both set far from city life. English Teacher present
 s the challenges of the “linguistic revolution” initiative\, while Bak
 hmaro 2050 is a meditation on the encroaching commercial development in a 
 mountainous resort town.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/english-teacher-and-bak
 hmaro-2050\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/english-teacher-and-bakhmaro-2050
