SUMMARY:Union Town
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Legendary documentary filmmaker Barbara Kopple completes the wo
 rkers’ trilogy she began fifty years ago with this vivid\, on-the-ground
  look at often rancorous labor struggles in the era of delivery apps and t
 he gig economy.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/union-town\nFrom Pushpin Bay Are
 a: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/union-town
END:VEVENT
