DTSTART:20261010T020000Z
DTEND:20261010T040000Z
SUMMARY:Elephants in the Fog
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:In the forests of southern Nepal\, a mother searches for her mi
 ssing daughter as wild elephants roam the night in a haunting and tender s
 tory of chosen family\, belonging\, and survival.\nhttps://bampfa.org/even
 t/elephants-fog\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/elephants-fog
END:VEVENT
